Do you have a magic marker to write more such scrolls with?

Anyway you should advance to XL14 and then go back to do the Quest.

Remember that eating a wraith corpse will gain you a level -- much faster 
than killing monsters.
 
> 4. I made more than 55,000 moves now.  Many of my spells keep getting
> faint as I move forward, but I can not afford to bring that 14
> spellbook along even with a bag of holding.  My spell repertoir
> includes

If you can, figure out which ones will expire within the next 5000 turns, 
and bring just those.

> [a] force bolt

Decent for smashing things, keep

> [b] cause fear

Keep charm monster instead.

> [c] turn undead

Junk.

> [d] clairvoyance

Bad version of magic mapping.  You can't afford to waste mana on this yet.

> [e] cure blindness

Junk.  You have a unicorn horn right?

> [f] jumping

Good for quick escapes and crossing holes, but expensive to use often.

> [g] magic missle

Excellent, gets even better as you gain more levels.

> [h] invisibility

Junk.

> [i] charm monster

Best spell ever.  If at first it doesn't work, cast it again.  Chance of 
success varies by monster, but the higher your XL the better.  You have to 
be adjacent, so more AC is good.

> [j] drain life

Save this book; it will come in handy later.

> [k] confuse monster

Don't bother.

> [l] create monster

If there aren't any powerful monsters around, you could cast this and then 
Charm Monster... or you could just wait for a powerful monster to show up.

> [m] light

This will prevent surprises, which is important when you have poor AC.

> [n] levitation

Try instead to find a ring that does the same thing.



